          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"section-3-routing\">Section 3: routing</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Routes are a plain list of (method, regex_pattern, handler) tuples, built once by compile_routes(). Matching is a linear scan; for a chat app with ~10 routes that's negligible.</span>\n</blockquote></span>"
